 用法二：技能自动加载"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"将 `skill/deepseek-harness-control/` 安装到 agent 技能目录："},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Codex：`~/.codex/skills/deepseek-harness-control/`\n- Claude Code：`~/.claude/skills/deepseek-harness"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"/.codex/skills/deepseek-harness-control/`\n- Claude Code：`~/.claude/skills/deepseek-harness-control/`"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"之后直接说需求（如「让 DeepSeek 修当前项目的 xxx bug」），agent 会自动按协议执行。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 工作流"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 换电脑部署"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. 拷贝整个文件夹（或便携包）到新电脑\n2. 安装 git / Node.js / pnpm + Codex 或 Claude Code 并登录\n3. 运行 `scripts/DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"rness 一键安装.bat` → `一键启动.bat`\n4. 安装技能或粘贴说明文件，即可使用"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 说明"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- `mailbox/`（信箱对话内容）已被 `.gitignore` 排除，不会入库\n- 具体任务的验收数值（频率、毫秒、文件清单）由每次 prompt 规定，本协议只管长期行为"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
